7: Yes, 7 divides 42.
14: Yes, 14 divides 42.

So all factors of 14 are also factors of 42? Wait, that can't be right. Wait, 14 is a factor of 42 because 42 ÷ 14 = 3. So yes, all of Rick's factors are also factors of 42. Therefore, the common factors are 1, 2, 7, 14. Therefore, there are 4 possible numbers they could be thinking of.

